{"municipality_code":"13117","pref":"東京都","city":"北区","headline":"街道の街の雰囲気が感じられる可能性があります。","display_comment_enriched":"北区には、浮間村、袋村、下村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、古墳や貝塚、寺社や信仰の場にまつわる場所が点在し、「赤羽台遺跡」、「西ヶ原遺跡」、「御殿前遺跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、浮間村や袋村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 川沿いや水辺では、暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を伝える案内板、治水碑、河川改修の記念碑にも注目してみてください。 人物に目を向けるなら、武将・武士の陸奥宗光との縁をたどることで、街の歴史をより立体的に楽しめます。 「稲付城跡」や「十条冨士塚」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":72,"rank":736,"percentile":61.1,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":63,"rank":320,"percentile":82.8,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":48,"rank":493,"percentile":73.3,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":24,"rank":216,"percentile":87.4,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":3,"rank":1013,"percentile":37.8,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":6,"rank":699,"percentile":57.7,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":2,"rank":320,"percentile":69.8,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":1,"rank":1563,"percentile":14.5,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_p